From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] matter: restore missing PythonPath helper

The pinned Matter source imports PythonPath from scripts/python_path.py in
both codegen entry points, but the file is absent from the source commit.
Provide the helper used to temporarily expose py_matter_idl.

Upstream-Status: Pending [not submitted upstream]

---
diff --git a/scripts/python_path.py b/scripts/python_path.py
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/scripts/python_path.py
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+import sys
+from pathlib import Path
+
+class PythonPath:
+    def __init__(self, path, relative_to):
+        self._path = str(Path(relative_to).resolve().parent / path)
+        self._added = False
+
+    def __enter__(self):
+        if self._path not in sys.path:
+            sys.path.insert(0, self._path)
+            self._added = True
+        return self
+
+    def __exit__(self, _exc_type, _exc_value, _traceback):
+        if self._added:
+            sys.path.remove(self._path)
